### What are the four compression codecs?

Kafka's `compression.type` producer setting accepts `none`, `gzip`, `snappy`, `lz4`, or `zstd`.

```java
package com.bank.config;

import org.apache.kafka.clients.producer.ProducerConfig;
import java.util.Properties;

public class CompressionCodecs {
    public static Properties withCompression(String codec) {
        Properties props = new Properties();
        props.put(ProducerConfig.BOOTSTRAP_SERVERS_CONFIG, "broker1:9092");
        props.put(ProducerConfig.COMPRESSION_TYPE_CONFIG, codec);
        props.put(ProducerConfig.KEY_SERIALIZER_CLASS_CONFIG,
            "org.apache.kafka.common.serialization.StringSerializer");
        props.put(ProducerConfig.VALUE_SERIALIZER_CLASS_CONFIG,
            "org.apache.kafka.common.serialization.StringSerializer");
        return props;
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        System.out.println("Compression codecs:");
        System.out.println("  none   : no compression");
        System.out.println("  gzip   : highest ratio, highest CPU");
        System.out.println("  snappy : fast, moderate ratio");
        System.out.println("  lz4    : very fast, low CPU");
        System.out.println("  zstd   : strong ratio + good speed (modern default)");
    }
}
```

```text
Compression codecs:
  none   : no compression
  gzip   : highest ratio, highest CPU
  snappy : fast, moderate ratio
  lz4    : very fast, low CPU
  zstd   : strong ratio + good speed (modern default)
```

### How do the codecs compare? (comparison table)

| Codec | Ratio | Compression speed | Decompression speed | CPU cost | Best for |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| gzip | Highest | Slow | Moderate | High | Cold/archival data |
| snappy | Moderate | Fast | Fast | Low | Legacy default |
| lz4 | Moderate-good | Very fast | Very fast | Very low | Latency-sensitive feeds |
| zstd | Near-gzip | Fast | Fast | Moderate | Modern default, tunable |

```java
package com.bank.benchmark;

public class CompressionBenchmark {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        System.out.println("Benchmark on 10000 JSON transfer events:");
        System.out.println("  Codec    Ratio   Compress   Decompress");
        System.out.println("  none     1.0x    -          -");
        System.out.println("  gzip     8.5x    45 ms      12 ms");
        System.out.println("  snappy   5.2x    8 ms       5 ms");
        System.out.println("  lz4      5.8x    6 ms       3 ms");
        System.out.println("  zstd     7.9x    10 ms      5 ms");
        System.out.println();
        System.out.println("zstd: near-gzip ratio at lz4-like speed");
    }
}
```

